            Otherwise — you missed an event, or just started — call <code class="bg-oled-elevated px-1 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-[11px]">List</code> with <code class="bg-oled-elevated px-1 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-[11px]">known</code> and take what it returns.
